-### Nerfacto Pipeline
-**Definition:** The default baseline model in Nerfstudio, integrating several advances from recent NeRF literature into a single, efficient pipeline for in-the-wild reconstruction [S3, unofficial].
-**Steps:** Combine a hash-grid encoding for compact and expressive scene representation. Use Mip-NeRF 360 proposal sampling for efficient ray sampling. Apply distortion loss from Mip-NeRF 360 to stabilize convergence. Apply scene contraction to handle unbounded scenes. Apply camera poses refinement. Apply appearance embeddings to account for illumination variations across input images [S3, unofficial].
